# Polenta workspace cache (T156) — machine-local absolute paths, fully regenerable, must
# never be versioned (T69-design.md). Catches nested Polenta projects dogfooded under this repo
# (e.g. apps/desktop/PL/) whose own .gitignore isn't guaranteed to cover the outer monorepo.
**/.polenta/tree.cache.yaml
